    "title": "Concept: What is Biodiversity?",
    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Biodiversity is the variety of all different species of organisms on Earth or within a specific ecosystem. Areas with <strong>high biodiversity</strong> contain many different species, while areas with <strong>low biodiversity</strong> have fewer species.</p>",
